{"thought":"I can see the results for race 18 (2008 Australian Grand Prix). The champion (position 1) has milliseconds = 5690616. The last finisher appears to be position 5 with milliseconds = 5708630 (positions 6+ are 'R' for retired). Let me calculate the percentage difference.","action":"execute_python","action_input":{"code":"import sqlite3\nconn = sqlite3.connect('db/results.db')\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\n# Get all results for race 18 where they finished (not 'R')\ncursor.execute(\"\"\"\n    SELECT positionOrder, milliseconds \n    FROM results \n    WHERE raceId = 18 AND positionText != 'R'\n    ORDER BY positionOrder ASC\n\"\"\")\nresults = cursor.fetchall()\nprint(\"Finishers:\")\nfor r in results:\n    print(f\"Position {r[0]}: {r[1]} ms\")\n\nif len(results) >= 2:\n    champion_ms = results[0][1]\n    last_finisher_ms = results[-1][1]\n    diff = last_finisher_ms - champion_ms\n    pct_faster = (diff / last_finisher_ms) * 100\n    print(f\"\\nChampion: {champion_ms} ms\")\n    print(f\"Last finisher: {last_finisher_ms} ms\")\n    print(f\"Difference: {diff} ms\")\n    print(f\"Percentage faster: {pct_faster:.4f}%\")\n\nconn.close()"}}
```
